## Known failure signature

[`HANDOFF.md`](HANDOFF.md): missing patch `InvP` → ~60 voxel centroid shift on `lidc_0001`.

## Agent rules

- New debug harness code → `det3d/extra/infer_debug/` (not `test_*.py` unless user asks).
- Extend suite via `fixtures/` + `streams/`; keep `step_runner.py` generic.
- Outputs under `/s/agent_rw/tmp/infer_debug/` by default.
